{"unit_id":"little-fire9552__dsh-healthkit-report#card-zh","repo":"little-fire9552/dsh-healthkit-report","commit":"94c8d5f2bae196e804c324da9daa420346265de5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-healthkit-report 是一个 DSH 工具插件，可读取 Apple 健康导出的 export.xml 或解压目录。它向 agent 注册 healthkit_report 工具，支持解析数据、计算健康指标、从已有数据集生成报告，也可一次完成全流程。插件会按设备优先级去重重叠记录，并支持日期筛选、DOCX/XLSX/HTML 报告和自定义报告姓名。适合希望将 Apple Health 数据整理为可阅读报告的用户；需要本地 Python 环境及报告所需的 Python 库。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:150-199","index.js:256-258","python/healthkit_report/cli.py:23-78","python/healthkit_report/parser.py:1-7"]}
